{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "unitId": "chapter-when-moral-seriousness-scales-parts-part-4-what-remains-possible-chapter-10-limited-but-real",
  "generationHash": "sha256:7ed2b39d144d464ed170de90492c4d1144de98feea462602acc2dc36f23174bd",
  "granularity": "segment-only",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "text": "Chapter 10: Limited but Real",
      "startMs": 0.0,
      "endMs": 2473.0,
      "charStart": 0,
      "charEnd": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "text": "Limited but Real",
      "startMs": 3588.0,
      "endMs": 4621.0,
      "charStart": 29,
      "charEnd": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "text": "By this point, the temptation is to measure moral seriousness by dominance.",
      "startMs": 5736.0,
      "endMs": 10566.0,
      "charStart": 47,
      "charEnd": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "text": "If restraint does not prevail, if asymmetry persists, if acceleration continues, it is easy to conclude that moral seriousness has failed.",
      "startMs": 10566.0,
      "endMs": 20109.0,
      "charStart": 122,
      "charEnd": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "text": "That conclusion confuses victory with value.",
      "startMs": 20469.0,
      "endMs": 23476.0,
      "charStart": 263,
      "charEnd": 307
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "text": "Moral seriousness may not dominate at scale.",
      "startMs": 23720.0,
      "endMs": 26854.0,
      "charStart": 309,
      "charEnd": 353
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "text": "It may not eliminate distance.",
      "startMs": 26854.0,
      "endMs": 28840.0,
      "charStart": 353,
      "charEnd": 383
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "text": "It may not dissolve asymmetry or neutralize incentive gradients.",
      "startMs": 28840.0,
      "endMs": 33298.0,
      "charStart": 383,
      "charEnd": 447
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "text": "Structural pressure is real.",
      "startMs": 33867.0,
      "endMs": 35852.0,
      "charStart": 450,
      "charEnd": 478
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "text": "Systems reward speed unevenly.",
      "startMs": 36235.0,
      "endMs": 38906.0,
      "charStart": 479,
      "charEnd": 509
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "text": "Actors who absorb cost may still lose influence.",
      "startMs": 39231.0,
      "endMs": 42760.0,
      "charStart": 510,
      "charEnd": 558
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "text": "But dominance was never the only measure.",
      "startMs": 43143.0,
      "endMs": 45744.0,
      "charStart": 560,
      "charEnd": 601
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "text": "The more modest—and more defensible—claim is that moral seriousness can preserve contestability.",
      "startMs": 46348.0,
      "endMs": 53175.0,
      "charStart": 603,
      "charEnd": 699
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "text": "It can prevent authority from becoming unquestionable.",
      "startMs": 53175.0,
      "endMs": 56832.0,
      "charStart": 699,
      "charEnd": 753
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "text": "It can resist the conversion of precedent into automatic permission.",
      "startMs": 56832.0,
      "endMs": 61278.0,
      "charStart": 753,
      "charEnd": 821
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "text": "Even when it does not control outcomes, it can keep disagreement visible and dissent survivable.",
      "startMs": 61278.0,
      "endMs": 67850.0,
      "charStart": 821,
      "charEnd": 917
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "text": "It can also slow harm.",
      "startMs": 68628.0,
      "endMs": 70346.0,
      "charStart": 922,
      "charEnd": 944
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "text": "Slowing harm is not dramatic.",
      "startMs": 70949.0,
      "endMs": 72854.0,
      "charStart": 946,
      "charEnd": 975
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "text": "It rarely generates headlines.",
      "startMs": 73028.0,
      "endMs": 74862.0,
      "charStart": 976,
      "charEnd": 1006
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "text": "It does not satisfy those who want decisive transformation.",
      "startMs": 74862.0,
      "endMs": 78368.0,
      "charStart": 1006,
      "charEnd": 1065
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "text": "Yet slowing harm prevents normalization.",
      "startMs": 78368.0,
      "endMs": 81724.0,
      "charStart": 1065,
      "charEnd": 1105
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "text": "It prevents escalation from becoming reflex.",
      "startMs": 82374.0,
      "endMs": 85148.0,
      "charStart": 1108,
      "charEnd": 1152
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "text": "It forces reconsideration where momentum would otherwise proceed unexamined.",
      "startMs": 85148.0,
      "endMs": 89967.0,
      "charStart": 1152,
      "charEnd": 1228
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "text": "In this sense, moral seriousness functions less as conquest and more as",
      "startMs": 90814.0,
      "endMs": 95749.0,
      "charStart": 1231,
      "charEnd": 1302
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "text": "constraint.",
      "startMs": 95818.0,
      "endMs": 96689.0,
      "charStart": 1303,
      "charEnd": 1314
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "text": "Constraint does not eliminate conflict.",
      "startMs": 97072.0,
      "endMs": 99568.0,
      "charStart": 1316,
      "charEnd": 1355
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "text": "It does not produce moral certainty.",
      "startMs": 99568.0,
      "endMs": 101855.0,
      "charStart": 1355,
      "charEnd": 1391
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "text": "It does something quieter: it preserves the conditions under which future judgment remains possible.",
      "startMs": 101855.0,
      "endMs": 108311.0,
      "charStart": 1391,
      "charEnd": 1491
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "text": "When harm cannot proceed automatically—when authority must be renewed, when dissent must be heard, when friction interrupts acceleration—the system remains corrigible.",
      "startMs": 108311.0,
      "endMs": 120176.0,
      "charStart": 1491,
      "charEnd": 1658
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "text": "Corrigibility is not collapse.",
      "startMs": 120838.0,
      "endMs": 123090.0,
      "charStart": 1663,
      "charEnd": 1693
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "text": "Survival is not failure.",
      "startMs": 123299.0,
      "endMs": 125157.0,
      "charStart": 1695,
      "charEnd": 1719
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "text": "In periods of thinning reciprocity and heightened asymmetry, the survival of judgment may be the most realistic achievement available.",
      "startMs": 125598.0,
      "endMs": 134143.0,
      "charStart": 1721,
      "charEnd": 1855
    },
    {
      "id": "s0033",
      "text": "To prevent harm from becoming automatic, to preserve spaces where agency still interrupts momentum, to refuse the equation of speed with necessity—these are limited outcomes.",
      "startMs": 134143.0,
      "endMs": 146299.0,
      "charStart": 1855,
      "charEnd": 2029
    },
    {
      "id": "s0034",
      "text": "They are also real.",
      "startMs": 147239.0,
      "endMs": 148621.0,
      "charStart": 2031,
      "charEnd": 2050
    },
    {
      "id": "s0035",
      "text": "Moral seriousness may not prevail.",
      "startMs": 149573.0,
      "endMs": 152127.0,
      "charStart": 2052,
      "charEnd": 2086
    },
    {
      "id": "s0036",
      "text": "It may persist.",
      "startMs": 152731.0,
      "endMs": 153996.0,
      "charStart": 2087,
      "charEnd": 2102
    },
    {
      "id": "s0037",
      "text": "That persistence is not trivial.",
      "startMs": 154600.0,
      "endMs": 156492.0,
      "charStart": 2104,
      "charEnd": 2136
    },
    {
      "id": "s0038",
      "text": "It is the difference between a system that accelerates without reflection and one that still remembers how to think.",
      "startMs": 156492.0,
      "endMs": 162971.0,
      "charStart": 2136,
      "charEnd": 2252
    },
    {
      "id": "s0039",
      "text": "“Constraint is not triumph.",
      "startMs": 163586.0,
      "endMs": 165734.0,
      "charStart": 2255,
      "charEnd": 2282
    },
    {
      "id": "s0040",
      "text": "It is the preservation of possibility.”",
      "startMs": 165908.0,
      "endMs": 168393.0,
      "charStart": 2283,
      "charEnd": 2322
    }
  ]
}
